      "alt": "Planning steps for Professional Courses for Commerce Students.",
      "caption": "Steps in the order they happen.",
      "heading": "Seven Course-Decision Rules",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 5,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "needId": "checklist:4",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "CS and CMA: the Indian Alternatives",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Run by ICSI."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Open to Indian nationals who passed or are appearing in Class 12."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Work is company law, governance, filings and board support."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Training is part of the route."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "cs-cma",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "needId": "chain:11",
            "type": "chain",
            "heading": "1 Judge the Specific Course",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "2 Compare with free alternatives first ICAI hosts its Foundation study material on its own knowledge portal."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "3 Ask what you will produce, not what you will pass Articleship, ACCA work experience and CFA work hours force real output."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "4 Remember that certificates alone are weak proof A CFA Level I pass or a set of ACCA papers without the work behind them does not make you a charterholder or member."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "5 Count the cost of outdated or wasted learning Rules change."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "6 Set total cost and time against your whole education budget Use roughly 10% of the full education budget as a starting limit for the course itself, and treat anything above about 20% as needing course-specific proof."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "rules",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 11
          },
          {
            "needId": "chain:13",
            "type": "chain",
            "heading": "AI Changes for Accounting and Compliance Work",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "1 Now Use AI to draft formulas, explain a tax provision or first-pass a reconciliation."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "2 Next Build one repeatable, checked workflow for a service you can sell, such as monthly compliance review for a small business."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "3 Later, as tools and adoption mature Value shifts to judgment, sign-off, advice and explaining numbers to an owner."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "ai",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 13
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:14",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Study-Abroad Caution for ACCA",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The US CPA exam can be taken in India, so you do not need to study abroad to start."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "ACCA is recognised in many places, but each country decides who may practise."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "CFA and FRM are exams plus work hours."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A large education loan that depends on a visa, a foreign job or an exchange rate is a high-risk commitment."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "abroad",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 14
          },
